    <rdfs:label>Document Publishing: revised under review states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the revised under review path of the Document Publishing workflow, in order: revised, under-review. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The publishing lifecycle of a document from the SPAR Publishing Status Ontology: draft, submission, review, acceptance or rejection, proof, publication, version of record, archive, with withdrawal, revision, embargo and retraction.</rdfs:comment>
