  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/mc-ughiox6q68f0ud0xos44ifwa">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ontology/sdc4-meta/ModelComponent"/>
    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdOrdinalType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Document Publishing: under review revised states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the under review revised path of the Document Publishing workflow, in order: under-review, revised. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The publishing lifecycle of a document from the SPAR Publishing Status Ontology: draft, submission, review, acceptance or rejection, proof, publication, version of record, archive, with withdrawal, revision, embargo and retraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
