    <sdc4-meta:isConstrainedByRmComponent rdf:resource="https://semanticdatacharter.com/ns/sdc4/sdc4.xsd#XdOrdinalType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Document Publishing: Main path states</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>States of the Main path path of the Document Publishing workflow, in order: draft, submitted, under-review, accepted-for-publication, proof, published, version-of-record, archived. A transition is legal between adjacent states. The publishing lifecycle of a document from the SPAR Publishing Status Ontology: draft, submission, review, acceptance or rejection, proof, publication, version of record, archive, with withdrawal, revision, embargo and retraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml"/>
  </rdf:Description>
